    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Normalized Ancestry Feat.</strong> Formerly granted automatically by <em>Furrykin (Vulpin)</em> at level 17; now available as an optional ancestry feat.</p><p><em>“You become the story that slips between lanternlight.”</em></p>\n        <p><strong>Fable-Shadow (1/Long Rest).</strong> For 1 minute, hostile creatures have disadvantage on attacks against you unless they succeed a Wisdom save at the start of their turn (DC = 8 + PB + Dex). Once per turn, you may force one attack to miss you (reaction) by ‘changing the story beat.’</p>",
